# Breeze-On — extract Markdown docs for external review

**Scope:** Breeze-On / BreezeOn only.

When the user asks to extract/export all `.md` documentation for external review (e.g. Copilot), follow the procedure in [`docs/documentation.md`](../../docs/documentation.md) § **External review export (agents)**.

Summary: one consolidated `.md` in Downloads; wrap each file with Repository / File name / Path / Full GitHub-style path; sources STANDARDS, SYSTEM-ADMIN-ADM, SYSTEM-SHARED-UI, `.github`; no zip; no GitHub push.
